some of those things,

00:49:07.260 --> 00:49:11.630
because of the most malleable
nature of software in some sense.

00:49:11.630 --> 00:49:15.970
So, therefore, I think there's
opportunity everywhere in the world.

00:49:15.970 --> 00:49:19.350
But, at the same time,
for you to come here,

00:49:19.350 --> 00:49:24.360
learn from, ;earning a place like
the GSB and being inspired and

00:49:24.360 --> 00:49:30.200
go back is an opportunity,
I would take if that came about, but

00:49:30.200 --> 00:49:36.370
at the same time, it doesn't mean that's
the only opportunity I had to have impact.

00:49:36.370 --> 00:49:38.960
It's interesting you bring
up because globalization,

00:49:38.960 --> 00:49:44.930
let's face it is going through
a little bit of a challenging phase.

00:49:44.930 --> 00:49:50.040
And I think that its deserved in
some sense because the globalization

00:49:50.040 --> 00:49:55.010
