where the inequities that

00:49:55.010 --> 00:49:58.470
were getting you know founded I guess.

00:49:58.470 --> 00:50:02.360
inequities that developed in local
communities were not addressed.

00:50:02.360 --> 00:50:08.510
Whatever happens in this next phase of
globalization will not only, in fact help,

00:50:08.510 --> 00:50:13.290
that grand convergence of opportunity all
over the world, which was, by the way,

00:50:13.290 --> 00:50:18.590
a very good thing in that first phase of
globalization, but also address the local

00:50:18.590 --> 00:50:23.460
inequities, whether it's in India or
in in Palo Alto.

00:50:23.460 --> 00:50:28.202
I think that that's what I think is needed
whereas there is real innovation that

00:50:28.202 --> 00:50:32.240
brings equitable growth everywhere
is perhaps the opportunity for

00:50:32.240 --> 00:50:33.671
GSB grads in 2019.

